    "name":  "Circular LED Ceiling Light 24W - 20W - 16W - OSRAM CHIP - CCT",
    "reference":  "CL24W-91123-CCT",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e24W CCT LED Surface Ceiling Light\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM\u003c/strong\u003e chip is a modern and energy-efficient luminaire designed to provide bright and uniform lighting in various indoor spaces.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith its power selector of \u003cstrong\u003e24W - 20W - 16W\u003c/strong\u003e, it is capable of generating a significant amount of light, making it an ideal choice for areas where intense lighting is required.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eCircular LED Ceiling Light 24W - 20W - 16W - OSRAM CHIP - CCT\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e24W CCT Surface Ceiling Light \u003c/strong\u003ewith \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM\u003c/strong\u003e CHIP is a modern and energy-efficient ceiling luminaire designed to provide bright and uniform lighting in various indoor spaces. With its power selector of \u003cstrong\u003e24W - 20W - 16W\u003c/strong\u003e, it is capable of generating a significant amount of light, making it an ideal choice for areas that require intense illumination.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Surface LED Panel uses OSRAM chips, which are known for their high efficiency and long-lasting performance. \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM chips\u003c/strong\u003e are recognized in the industry for their ability to produce superior quality lighting, consistent brightness, and extended lifespan. This ensures that the LED panel is a long-term investment and provides reliable lighting for many hours of use.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn addition to its lighting performance, the design of the Surface LED Panel is sleek and discreet, making it an aesthetic choice for any type of environment. Being designed for surface mounting on the ceiling, it is easy to install and does not require complicated installation work.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eThe Circular LED Ceiling Light 24W - 20W - 16W - OSRAM CHIP - CCT offers a wide range of uses and benefits, making it a popular choice in various settings.\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVersatile Usability: Due to its design and lighting performance, the LED panel is suitable for a variety of applications. It can be used in residential spaces such as living rooms, bedrooms, kitchens, and hallways, providing bright and uniform lighting throughout the space. It is also an excellent choice for commercial environments such as offices, retail stores, and exhibition spaces, where quality lighting is required to highlight products and create a pleasant ambiance.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEnergy Efficiency: One of the main benefits of the LED panel is its high energy efficiency. By using advanced LED technology, the panel consumes less energy compared to traditional light sources, resulting in significant savings on the electricity bill in the long run. This is not only beneficial for the owner or user, but also for the environment by reducing the carbon footprint.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLong Lifespan: Thanks to the high-quality OSRAM chips used in its construction, the Surface LED Panel has a long lifespan. OSRAM chips are known for their durability and resistance to wear, which means the panel can reliably operate for many hours without degrading its lighting performance. This reduces long-term replacement and maintenance costs.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEasy Installation: The Surface LED Panel is designed for easy installation on the ceiling surface. It comes with all the necessary accessories and mounting instructions, making it easy to install in any space. No specialized technical knowledge or complicated installation work is required, saving time and effort.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdaptability and Flexibility: An additional advantage of adjustable color temperature light sources is their adaptability to different situations and needs. Dimmable lights or adjustable screens allow for changing the color temperature according to preference or the specific task at hand. This can be particularly useful in multifunctional spaces or environments where lighting needs vary.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn our online store, we ensure that our products have quality assurance and provide all the necessary elements for distribution, import, or wholesale, including the technical specifications for each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
